{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/14314","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/14314/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/14314/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/issues/14314/events","html_url":"https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js/issues/14314","id":333145902,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUzMzMxNDU5MDI=","number":14314,"title":"Incorrect example in SkinnedMesh documentation","user":{"login":"CakeWithSteak","id":37267737,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjY3NzM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37267737?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CakeWithSteak","html_url":"https://github.com/CakeWithSteak","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CakeWithSteak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CakeWithSteak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CakeWithSteak/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CakeWithSteak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CakeWithSteak/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CakeWithSteak/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CakeWithSteak/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CakeWithSteak/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CakeWithSteak/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":58674,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1ODY3NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mrdoob/three.js/labels/Bug","name":"Bug","color":"b60205","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2018-06-18T06:23:07Z","updated_at":"2020-03-22T03:29:55Z","closed_at":"2018-06-18T17:18:58Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"The example in the [SkinnedMesh documentation page](https://threejs.org/docs/#api/objects/SkinnedMesh) creates a `CylinderBufferGeometry`, and later tries to set skin indices and weights like this:\r\n```javascript\r\ngeometry.skinIndices.push( new THREE.Vector4( skinIndex, skinIndex + 1, 0, 0 ) );\r\ngeometry.skinWeights.push( new THREE.Vector4( 1 - skinWeight, skinWeight, 0, 0 ) );\r\n```\r\nHowever, this code doesn't work since `BufferGeometry` doesn't have the `skinIndices` and `skinWeights` properties - those are only present in `Geometry`.\r\n\r\nThe issue could be fixed by either changing `CylinderBufferGeometry` to `CylinderGeometry` or setting the skin weights and indices as attributes in the `BufferGeometry`\r\n(NOTE: The embedded example on the page correctly uses a `CylinderGeometry`, only the code provided below it is incorrect)","closed_by":{"login":"mrdoob","id":97088,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk3MDg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97088?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob","html_url":"https://github.com/mrdoob","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrdoob/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com